# Keep documentation current

When changing **user-visible** addon behavior, update the matching docs in the **same task**.

Follow the code → doc mapping in [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md). Start from [docs/README.md](../../docs/README.md).

Do not recreate deleted root `ALTARMY_TBC_*.md` specs. Do not dump feature catalogs into AGENTS.md.
